  "notes": [
    "The possessive determiner agrees in gender and number with the POSSESSED noun, not with the owner (a minha mãe, o meu pai — same owner 'eu', form follows mãe/pai).",
    "EP normally uses the definite article before the possessive: a minha mãe, o nosso carro, os teus livros.",
    "For the 3rd person EP prefers dele/dela/deles/delas placed AFTER the noun (o carro dele) over seu/sua, because seu/sua is read as the formal 'your (você)' and is ambiguous."
  ],
